---
---
<section id="inicio" class="relative min-h-[calc(100svh-80px)] flex items-center overflow-hidden scroll-mt-20 bg-surface-dim">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[40%_center] brightness-65" src="/images/larminer-hero-training.webp" alt="Estudiante de maquinaria pesada junto a una retroexcavadora en el campo de prácticas" fetchpriority="high" />
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 w-full px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto py-24">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-5xl md:text-[72px] text-white mb-6 uppercase max-w-2xl">Aprende haciendo. <span class="text-primary">Opera en grande.</span></h1>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-white/85 mb-10 max-w-xl">Fórmate en 6 máquinas con práctica en equipos reales, instructores de campo y certificación por cada equipo aprendido.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                <a class="bg-primary text-on-primary font-headline-md text-headline-md px-10 py-5 font-bold uppercase border-b-4 border-[#bd8700] active:translate-y-1 active:border-b-0 transition-all hover:bg-primary-container text-center" href="#inscripcion">Quiero matricularme</a>
                <a class="border-2 border-white/60 text-white font-headline-md text-headline-md px-10 py-5 font-bold uppercase hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2" href="/verifica">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">qr_code_scanner</span>
                    Verifica certificado
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-2xl">
                <div class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-[#062846]/80 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><strong class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary block">6 equipos</strong><span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-white/70">Un programa integral</span></div>
                <div class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-[#062846]/80 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><strong class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary block">Chiclayo</strong><span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-white/70">Lambayeque, Perú</span></div>
                <div class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-[#062846]/80 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><strong class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary block">Certificación</strong><span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-white/70">Por máquina aprendida</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
